AI Training Plan & Journey Generator:-


This project is a multi-interface application designed to generate structured, real-world learning paths and manage training tracking using Google Gemini AI models via LangChain. It provides both a web UI (Streamlit) and API endpoints (FastAPI) to handle training generations and session tracking.
Overview:-The AI Training Plan Generator is a robust backend and frontend integration project that leverages the Gemini AI model to curate personalized training curricula based on specific topics and skill levels. By combining the power of FastAPI for high-performance API services, LangChain for seamless LLM integration, and a containerized infrastructure, this project provides a scalable foundation for automated educational content generation.

Project Structure:-
The repository is organized to separate business logic from interface implementation:
1.ai_engine.py: Contains the core logic for communicating with the Gemini model using LangChain to generate training content.
2.main.py: Serves as the FastAPI application entry point, exposing endpoints like /get-plan and /generate-plan to trigger the AI generation process.
3.api.py: Functions as an additional interface layer for handling API requests.
4.requirements.txt: Lists all necessary dependencies, including fastapi, uvicorn, langchain, and google-generativeai. 
5.Dockerfile: Defines the container environment, ensuring the application runs consistently across different operating systems by packaging the Python runtime and dependencies.  
6.tempCodeRunnerFile.py: A transient file generated during development that manages execution tasks for the interface. 

Key Features:-
1.Automated Curriculum Design: Dynamically generates detailed study paths for any given subject. 
2.Scalable API Architecture: Built using FastAPI, enabling asynchronous processing and easy integration into larger systems. 
3.Simplified Deployment: Full Docker support allows for deployment in any container-compatible environment with a single command.  
4.Modern AI Integration: Utilizes gemini-2.5-flash to deliver high-quality, relevant training content through the LangChain framework. 

